# SOP applicability and version supplement 0.1

Revision `sop-rules-addendum-20261016-0.1`, dated 2026-10-16 (Asia/Shanghai). This English reference follows the [original Chinese supplement](../规范补充-20261016/适用与版本.md). It maintains rules from material already submitted. Project requirement confirmation, application acceptance, and external certification each require their own evidence. The handoff contract and skill remain at version 0.2. Record the supplement revision separately when adopting it.

## 1. Current guidance and historical snapshots

This directory supplements the current document rules. Preserve the source snapshots bound by their corresponding provenance files. Apply this supplement and the shared conventions to the historical interaction and format rules below. Preserve other original conditions. Follow the user's current explicit instructions and obtain the applicable project decisions before changing requirements or machine contracts.

